{"server":"tw","storyId":"act15d5_level_act15d5_st02","groupId":"act15d5","stageId":null,"title":"荒野路漫漫","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d5/level_act15d5_st02.txt","sourceHash":"4b83062480a50ce4b354bb75af0abae055d9e0da5ab6efcc4064c9d480b13e1e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"敘拉古中西部的荒野上，三個從城中逃出來的青年，駕駛著偷來的車，開始了他們全新的旅途。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"漫無邊際的荒野上，一名紅髮沃爾珀男性正蹲在地上聚精會神地看著什麼。\n在他身後不遠處有一輛車，一名白髮魯珀男性和一名黑髮菲林正在檢查車輛。\n三人看起來是同行者，而他們的車似乎出了故障。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，奧斯塔，快過來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"你來看這些蟲子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"它們排成一排走得好有規律啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"而且它們的隊伍拉得還挺長的，讓我看看它們打算去哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......你看起來精神了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，我現在感覺我好多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我不太相信你對自己身體的判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"你是我老媽嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"你半小時前還咳血了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，但是我現在沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，糟了，光顧著跟你說話，蟲子爬走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我去繼續修車了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，車子什麼問題你們查出來沒有啊，要不要我來幫忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"管道出了一些故障，發動機發動不起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我和布洛卡應付得來，你別到處亂跑就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你讓我到處亂跑，這邊什麼都沒有，我也跑不到哪裡去啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"隨著一陣轟鳴聲，引擎終於重新發動了起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......布洛卡，去把賈維叫回來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，布洛卡，來比賽誰尿得比較遠啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"......我現在尿不出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"別在這種時候正經回答他，布洛卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"真是可惜，現在可是適合尿尿的天氣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得除了極寒的地方，大概也沒有不適合尿......小便的天氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"這你就不懂了，奧斯塔，這種事講究一個感覺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，完美的弧線——*敘拉古常用語*！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"忽然刮來一陣大風把我完美的弧線吹到我的鞋上了！嘖，真倒楣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......別鬧了，該出發了，如果我們不能在日落前找到一個聚集地，今天就要在荒野上睡覺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"荒野不好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說起來，我還沒有露營過呢！我們今天來露營吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"荒野上很危險，而且從根本上來說，這輛偷來的車上並沒有露營裝備，我們只能睡在車上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，燃料也是一個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"切，真是不上道的車主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得一般城裡的車主也不會在車上準備露營的東西，更不會準備額外的燃料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"但是準備一下又沒有壞處，誰知道自己的車哪天會不會被人借走開去露營呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"你會嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"那就閉嘴準備出發了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"要出發了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我來開吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼，該我了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"你好好休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"奧斯塔，我最近發現你越來越像老媽了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，布洛卡，你有沒有這麼覺得？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"有一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你們兩個得了礦石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說良好的生活習慣對抑制病情有幫助，你每天應該早點睡，賈維。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊，你知道嗎，奧斯塔，我媽都沒有對我說過這句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"*敘拉古問候語*閉嘴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"奧斯塔說著發動了引擎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"聽什麼歌好呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，這輛車的車主聽的歌還不少......啊哈，這個封面不錯，就這首吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"隨著賈維將翻找出的唱片塞入車載音響中，歡快的音樂從音響中傳出——\n“♪周六我想騎我的馱獸”\n“♪像個巨星一樣帶著禮物出現在你的家門口”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"（口哨聲）還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"確實。那麼，繼續前進吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，奧斯塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在在往哪裡開？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"這個問題我在出發時應該就告訴過你答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得你可能只是根本沒有聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我們溜出來的時候，我順手拿了一張地圖，我們現在姑且在往最近的拉克瑪蒂瓦城開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得那邊和我們家族的勢力關係不算壞，運氣好的話，我們可以加入他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"不行也至少有個地方可以落腳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我以前聽說敘拉古的西邊有個好像很古怪的鎮子，裡面經常鬧鬼，我們去那裡看看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"別做夢了，我們根本不知道它在哪裡，而且說不定根本就是別人編的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"那要不然我們去其他十二家族在的城市看看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，雖然說西西里聯盟也是十三家族之一，但是整天自己搞來搞去，什麼聯盟，哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟西西里聯盟不像那些真正的大家族一樣有組織，是由許多大小家族組成的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"那些大家族的人可不會在乎我們這些西西里聯盟的無名小卒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，總有一天他們會來求我加入他們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"反正懷特城暫時是回不去了......不，或許是永遠都回不去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我們把特林家族也惹惱了，懷特已經沒有我們的立足之地了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，畢竟捅了那麼大的簍子，我還挺想看看老大的，啊呸、林頓的那張醜臉現在是什麼表情的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......確實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，事到如今後悔也遲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"後悔......倒是不至於，畢竟林頓確實是個混帳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"把我們賣了還想讓我們幫他數錢，不可能的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我也不後悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，別想了，有些家族不還把第一次出獄當成一些新成員真正加入家族的儀式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"而昨天，我們反抗了我們原本的家族，並從那座城市裡逃了出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"所以現在我宣佈，你們都是我賈維家族真正的成員了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"奧斯塔，你就是家族首席軍師了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡，你就是家族首席打手了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“♪但當你對著地板笑的時候不難察覺——”\n“♪你不知道——”\n“♪你不知道你很醜！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，開了這麼久，一個人都沒見到啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"城外除了少數的一些聚集地和村落，本來就幾乎不會有行人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"因為有些在城市裡混不下去的家族會在荒野上肆虐，我以前跟過幾次家族裡的商隊，每次都會做好充足的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"像我們現在這樣完全沒有準備就跑到荒野上的人，一般只有死路一條。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，死路一條，這個說法我喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"不過也是，我在修車廠的時候也見過那些要出去的傢伙都會來準備很多東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，要是逃出來的時候能多帶點吃的就好了。奧斯塔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"後備箱裡那些吃的你想都別想，那是我們應急用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"能逃出來已經不錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是昨晚正好是曼德爾守門，我們現在大概已經被蒙上眼綁在椅子上坐在小黑屋裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡，下次這種時候記得提醒我多帶點吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，真沒勁啊，明明有這麼廣闊的土地卻不能用起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"你看這邊，我們就在這裡建一個這————麼大的修車廠，然後就在裡面搞改裝車，那該有多爽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"為了躲避天災啊，我們無法抵抗天災。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，天災，礦石病，這片大地上就沒什麼好事啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡，就沒有什麼有趣的事情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛看完的書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"講什麼的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"一對戀人因為所屬家族之間的矛盾而最終被拆散的小說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"......結局很感人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。你怎麼還帶了這樣的書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"因為奧斯塔說路上會很無聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，布洛卡，我之前就挺好奇的，你很喜歡看這些嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"也沒有很喜歡，只是空閒的時候看看，還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧。哎，說到這個，奧斯塔，你有沒有交過女朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，我也沒有。不知道談戀愛有什麼意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，奧斯塔，你該不會也喜歡看這些書吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我更喜歡看一些有關政治和歷史的書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，不該問你的，我聽到這兩個字就想睡了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“♪她在一支維多利亞樂隊裡吹口琴。”\n“♪她卻愛上了一個哥倫比亞男人。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，來點什麼刺激的事吧——嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，奧斯塔，看那邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"求求你們，我上有老母，下有孩子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強盜頭領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"滾開，老子也上有老下有小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強盜頭領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"乖乖閉嘴，惹老子不高興了老子在你身上開幾個洞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，奧斯塔，布洛卡，我有一個想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"不要告訴我你想加入他們一起搶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？我是說我們把這幫強盜幹掉，然後問這群商人要點物資什麼的，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，不過你這個提議也不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"不，還是用你的計畫吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們要是不給，我們再搶就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊！那就，全速前進，把那個蠢貨撞飛吧！布洛卡，準備打架了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強盜A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，看那邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強盜頭領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，給我倒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強盜B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）我來給你們創造機會，你們趁機......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）好，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，布洛卡，你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我盡力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強盜A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說什麼悄悄話呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強盜頭領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"滾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強盜頭領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，還挺不好對付，過來，一起拖住他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強盜C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"哼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強盜B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小白臉，哪裡走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"趁現在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在奧斯塔有意的引導下，強盜們一時間忽略了商人的存在，而商人則在奧斯塔的提醒下抓住這個空檔，跳上車。\n而後，隨著一陣轟鳴聲，車子絕塵而去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強盜頭領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*敘拉古問候語*，你們三個小畜生！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，那我們的物資怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"活下來再說！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"趁著商人吸引了強盜們的時間，奧斯塔也跳上了他們的車並發動了引擎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"賈維，上車！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"噢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不等賈維反應，奧斯塔先一步發動了車輛衝入強盜陣中。\n不過賈維對此早已習慣，閃過兩人後，趁著車輛尚未加速，抓住門把翻身入內。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強盜A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別想跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"布洛卡猛地一揮手中鑽頭逼退身邊的強盜，並在奧斯塔駕駛的車輛駛經身邊時翻身進入車內。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"抓穩了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強盜頭領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，別讓他們跑了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雖然強盜們想要停下三人的車，不過已經發動的車輛並沒有那麼容易停下。最終，三人組的車順利衝出了強盜們的包圍，向著地平線駛去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強盜頭領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還愣著幹什麼？！你、你、還有你，你們去追那個商人，剩下的都去追那三個小畜生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強盜頭領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今天他們必須死在這片荒野上不可！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強盜們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，奧斯塔，快看，他們追上來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道！繫好安全帶，我要加速了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“♪舉起你的手 移到腹部”\n“♪不要失去你的呼吸 用力去跳”\n“♪把自己融入到人群中 一切才剛開始”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"即使奧斯塔把車速提到極限，強盜們也依然緊咬不放。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"真是群不死心的傢伙，哈——咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"賈維，別把頭探出去看他們了，關上窗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"你——說——什——麼？風太大我沒聽見！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡，把他拉回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳咳——幹什麼幹什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"奧斯塔讓你不要探出頭去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"賈維你怎麼了，忽然咳嗽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，大概是因為風灌進嘴巴了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"最好是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一個好消息和一個壞消息，你們要聽哪個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"壞消息吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"燃料快沒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，那好消息呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"好消息是，看起來在燃料見底前，我們可以把他們甩開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯，在這裡能看到移動城市的牆壁了啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那裡應該就是拉克瑪蒂瓦城了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，看起來真不錯，比我們懷特氣派——咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"老實說，賈維，你沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你也來一起推車吧，看著很近，要走的話我覺得可能一天都走不完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"這車都沒燃料了，我們還要它幹嘛？走過去還快一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"其實燃料還剩了一點，我打算在接近城市或者他們追上來的時候再用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，這可是我們現在手上最值錢的東西了，你難道想空著手去一座陌生的城市打拼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"（口哨）好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雖然帶著滿不在乎的表情，不過賈維還是走到車的一角，和另外兩人一起推起了車。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，奧斯塔，我開個音響聽歌可以吧，耗不了多少燃料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......這個倒是可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"好，哈，讓我看看——這次聽這個吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“♪你好，光明，我的老朋友”\n“♪我又想同你談一談”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"——嘖，一點也不勁爆啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是覺得還挺好聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"我也覺得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧，既然你們都喜歡那就這個好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，說起來，奧斯塔，你還記得我們怎麼認識的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"當時你還是個修車工，然後把我家族的人打了一頓，我是被派去收拾你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，然後我們兩個不打不相識，在那之後成了好朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"喂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事。布洛卡呢，你還記得嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我永遠都不會忘，是你們兩個救了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，沒錯，你這傢伙真夠憨的，被自己家族賣了都不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"不過放心，我絕對不會賣了你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......這麼一想，我們認識還真是相當久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"賈維，你還是去車上休息吧，不要逞強，我和布洛卡來推車就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我可沒有逞強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡，我們兩個應該是一起得礦石病的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得不是，你們只是差不多同時被檢查出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡應該是哪次火拼被人用源石製品劃傷的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"至於你這傢伙，平時根本不注意什麼防護措施，什麼時候得都不奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"是是是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，奧斯塔，你整天跟我們在一起，你總有一天也會得這個病吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"或許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"不過就算得了我覺得也不是什麼壞事就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？為啥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"比看著你們兩個難受要好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，不愧是我的好兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"你今天廢話真多，還是躺車上好好休息吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"奧斯塔，我決定在我討厭的東西列表上加上一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"那是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是礦石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......布洛卡，把賈維搬到車上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一路上都十分沉默的布洛卡聞言走過去，將賈維直接抱起並放進了車的後座，而後回到原本的位置繼續推車。\n而賈維躺在車上，似乎是覺得陽光太過耀眼，他用手臂遮住了雙眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，因為這個病，我們被林頓那個混帳當做棄子一樣隨手就扔掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"還害得我呼吸都感覺不太通暢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"奧斯塔，等我們以後成為了十三家族的首領，我一定要想辦法把這個礦石病解決掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，我們到時候就請許多醫生專門研究這個病，或者找那些很厲害的醫院，給他們錢讓他們去研究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，沒錯。然後小爺我還要造一家大醫院，把那些因為得了病被看不起的傢伙全給丟進去然後把他們都治好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"再把看不起他們的人全都收拾一頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"我也來幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你當然要來幫忙，奧斯塔也要來，別忘了，你們可是我的首席軍師和打手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。賈維，別說話了，好好休息吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，奧斯塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得死在荒野上怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是要成為十三家族的首領嗎？怎麼可以死在這種地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我剛才仔細想了想，就這麼死在荒野上好像也沒什麼不好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"再偉大的人死了也要進墳墓的，死在荒野上和死在幾百萬一張的床上又有什麼區別？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"找幾塊石頭，挖個坑，躺進去，然後閉上眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啪——一個人死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來也沒那麼壞嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，賈維，你到底在說什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"我在說，今天的天空，真*敘拉古語氣助詞*藍啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"“♪請把我埋在，無邊的荒野。”\n“♪啊朋友再見吧，再見吧，再見——”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"或許是蓄電池的容量耗盡，車載音響播放的音樂也戛然而止。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"賈維，賈維？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼可以死在這種地方？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡，上車，我要去找找附近有沒有聚集地，最好能找到人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奧斯塔，他只是睡著了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......這傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過，賈維的病情還是不容樂觀，我們最好還是能找到一個願意治療感染者的醫生......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你們的車好像出了問題，需要幫忙嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"給，三人份的刺身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，終於來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，賈維小哥你們就是那個時候被羅德島搭救了才加入羅德島的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"並沒有，那個幹員代號是直尺，直尺把我們帶到了拉克瑪蒂瓦的羅德島辦事處，然後請駐紮在那裡的醫療幹員給賈維做了一些治療。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，孑你的手藝真是沒得說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝誇獎。我還以為你們就那麼加入羅德島了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能啊，那時我們又不熟，而且為了換藥，奧斯塔還把車交出去了，我當時覺得羅德島還挺會盤算的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"不過羅德島的藥是挺有效的，對吧，布洛卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"確實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"至於我們為什麼加入羅德島，簡單來說，就是賈維惹惱了拉克瑪蒂瓦裡一個家族的老大，我們又被追殺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"這一次，又是直尺救了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"然後在他的引薦下，我們乾脆就來到了羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，說真的，奧斯塔，那可不能怪我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來又是一個新故事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，孑老哥你有沒有時間，我給你好好說說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"都已經半夜了，明天也沒有什麼任務，我去拿點我從龍門帶來的酒，一邊喝一邊說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，那太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"那天晚上，我和奧斯塔正要去見......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"深夜的食堂中，男人們的故事會還在繼續著......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_272_strong","aliases":["孑"]},{"speakerId":"char_346_aosta","aliases":["奧斯塔"]},{"speakerId":"char_349_chiave","aliases":["賈維"]},{"speakerId":"char_356_broca","aliases":["布洛卡"]}]}
